<p><p>Ya zahra madarjaan..(2)<br />
ya zahra, zahra madar madarjaan</p>

<p>1. Biz&#39;ate qalb e nabi umme abeeha zehra<br />
tere baba ne tujhe rutba diya maa jaisa<br />
jab utha shab ki siyahi me janaza tera<br />
qabr e sarkar e do aalam se ye aati thi sadaa</p>

<p>Ya zahra madarjaan..(2)<br />
ya zahra, zahra madar madarjaan</p>

<p>2. Ye sada dete hai khud haath ke chaale tere<br />
tune hasnain ko paala hai badi mehnat se<br />
zeher shabbar ko mila yu mila mehnat ka sila<br />
khoo ugalte hue kehte the jigar ke tukde</p>

<p>Ya zahra madarjaan..(2)<br />
ya zahra, zahra madar madarjaan</p>

<p>3. Phir wo din aaya ke sarwar ne madina chhoda<br />
teri turbat hui veeran basi karbobala<br />
roze ashoor azan e ali akbar sunkar<br />
ghar ki dehleez pe baithi hui sughra ne kaha</p>

<p>Ya zahra madarjaan..(2)<br />
ya zahra, zahra madar madarjaan</p>

<p>4. Hogaya jung ka aghaaz sare karbobala<br />
sabse pehle gaya maidaan me hurr ka beta<br />
bhai maara gaya fir hurr bhi gaya sue jina<br />
zakhm pe shaah ne rumaal jo bandha to kaha</p>

<p>Ya zahra madarjaan..(2)<br />
ya zahra, zahra madar madarjaan</p>

<p>5. Us taraf zainab e dilgeer ye karti thi dua<br />
mere farzand ho pyaase mere bhai pe fida<br />
pur asar saniye zehra ki dua hoke rahi<br />
laash bacho ki jo dekhi to ye zainab ne kaha</p>

<p>Ya zahra madarjaan..(2)<br />
ya zahra, zahra madar madarjaan</p>

<p>6. Laut kar aaya na saqqa e haram darya se<br />
hogaye haath qalam teer kaleje me lage<br />
hogaya thanda alam sheh ki kamar toot gayi<br />
tod kar kooza sakina ne kaha rote hue</p>

<p>Ya zahra madarjaan..(2)<br />
ya zahra, zahra madar madarjaan</p>

<p>7. Ek kohraam bapa khaima e sarwar me hua<br />
ghar se atthara baras wala jo maqtal ko chala<br />
barchi akbar ke kaleje se jo sheh ne khaichi<br />
haath seene pe rakha aur ye akbar ne kaha</p>

<p>Ya zahra madarjaan..(2)<br />
ya zahra, zahra madar madarjaan</p>

<p>8. Door bano se hua haaye wo nanha baccha<br />
loriya deti hai besheer ko ab khaak e shifa<br />
che mahine ke mujahid pe qayamat guzri<br />
teer khakar ali asghar ke tabassum ne kaha</p>

<p>Ya zahra madarjaan..(2)<br />
ya zahra, zahra madar madarjaan</p>

<p>9. Sheh ne rehan rakha sajda e mabood me sar<br />
shimr ka chalne laga sukhe gale par khanjar<br />
yaad aane lagi maa alame tanhai me<br />
rukh baqiyya ki taraf karke pukare sarwar</p>

<p>Ya zahra madarjaan..(2)<br />
ya zahra, zahra madar madarjaan</p>
